      "key": "fr08_marmot_3",
      "nodeTitle": "marmot",
      "sourceText": "Uwielbiam jeść kwiaty, owoce i zioła. Pycha!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love eating flowers, fruits, and herbs. Yum!",
